# 🚨 Emergency Procedures

## **Network Down**

```bash
# 1. Emergency recovery
sudo /home/outspoken/Cerberus-V/scripts/panic.sh

# 2. If still down, reboot
sudo reboot
```

## **Cursor Can't Save**

```bash
# 1. Fix permissions
sudo /home/outspoken/Cerberus-V/scripts/fix-cursor-permissions.sh

# 2. Restart Cursor
pkill -f cursor
cursor &
```

## **eBPF Program Won't Load**

```bash
# 1. Check kernel headers
sudo dnf install kernel-devel-$(uname -r)

# 2. Check BTF
bpftool feature probe

# 3. Fallback to TC
./scripts/load_firewall_adaptive.sh wlp0s20f0u12 tc
```

